ame=\"principles section index\">\n                — 02 / 04 · Principles\n            </p>\n            <div class=\"section-inner\" data-kid=\"1-6-1-2\" data-name=\"section content container\">\n                <div class=\"principles-grid\" data-dynamic=\"true\" data-kid=\"1-6-1-2-1\" data-name=\"principles grid layout\" data-reason=\"transform modified by scroll-triggered animation\">\n                    <article class=\"principle\" data-kid=\"1-6-1-2-1-1\" data-name=\"principle 1 card\" data-reveal=\"\">\n                        <p class=\"principle-number\" data-kid=\"1-6-1-2-1-1-1\" data-name=\"principle 1 number\">\n                            01\n                        </p>\n                        <h3 class=\"principle-title\" data-kid=\"1-6-1-2-1-1-2\" data-name=\"principle 1 title\">\n                            Starts with a question.\n                        </h3>\n                        <p class=\"principle-desc\" data-kid=\"1-6-1-2-1-1-3\" data-name=\"principle 1 description\">\n                            Turns curiosity into experiments, then makes the next step visible.\n                        </p>\n                        <div class=\"principle-detail items-center\" data-kid=\"1-6-1-2-1-1-4\" data-name=\"principle 1 details\">\n                            <kbd class=\"kbd\" data-kid=\"1-6-1-2-1-1-4-1\" data-name=\"kbd command key icon\">\n                                ⌘\n                            </kbd>\n                            <kbd class=\"kbd\" data-kid=\"1-6-1-2-1-1-4-2\" data-name=\"kbd key n icon\">\n                                N\n                            </kbd>\n                            <span class=\"tag-minimal\" data-kid=\"1-6-1-2-1-1-4-3\" data-name=\"tag minimal text\">\n                                from any notebook\n                            </span>\n                        </div>\n                    </article>\n                    <article class=\"principle\" data-kid=\"1-6-1-2-1-2\" data-name=\"principle 2 card\" data-reveal=\"\">\n                        <p class=\"principle-number\" data-kid=\"1-6-1-2-1-2-1\" data-name=\"principle 2 number\">\n                            02\n                        </p>\n                        <h3 class=\"principle-title\" data-kid=\"1-6-1-2-1-2-2\" data-name=\"principle 2 title\">\n                            Lives in the evidence.\n                        </h3>\n                        <p class=\"principle-desc\" data-kid=\"1-6-1-2-1-2-3\" data-name=\"principle 2 description\">\n                            Papers, datasets, terminal output — the context stays close, so ideas can move.\n                        </p>\n                        <div class=\"principle-detail\" data-kid=\"1-6-1-2-1-2-4\" data-name=\"principle 2 tags\">\n                            <span class=\"tag\" data-kid=\"1-6-1-2-1-2-4-1\" data-name=\"tag papers\">\n                                papers\n                            </span>\n                            <span class=\"tag\" data-kid=\"1-6-1-2-1-2-4-2\" data-name=\"tag datasets\">\n                                datasets\n                            </span>\n                            <span class=\"tag\" data-kid=\"1-6-1-2-1-2-4-3\" data-name=\"tag notebooks\">\n                                notebooks\n                            </span>\n                            <span class=\"tag\" data-kid=\"1-6-1-2-1-2-4-4\" data-name=\"tag terminal\">\n                                terminal\n                            </span>\n                        </div>\n                    </article>\n                    <article class=\"principle\" data-kid=\"1-6-1-2-1-3\" data-name=\"principle 3 card\" data-reveal=\"\">\n                        <p class=\"principle-number\" data-kid=\"1-6-1-2-1-3-1\" data-name=\"principle 3 number\">\n                            03\n                        </p>\n                        <h3 class=\"principle-title\" data-kid=\"1-6-1-2-1-3-2\" data-name=\"principle 3 title\">\n   